<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Feedgrain buys 50,000T of corn.</title>
<headline>Korea Feedgrain buys 50,000T of corn.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Feedgrain Purchase Committee (KFPC) bought 50,000 tonnes of corn from Tradigrain through a private negotiation, traders said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Traders said arrival was set by April 30 to Inchon.</p>
<p>Details for the results are as follows:</p>
<p>    PRICE(C&amp;F)	 SHIPMENT</p>
<p>    $139.48	    Mar 29-April 17 (PNW)</p>
<p>    $138.48	    Mar 12-31 (U.S. Gulf)</p>
<p>    $138.48	    Mar 7-26 (S.Africa)</p>
<p>    $135.48	    Apr 11-30 (China)</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
